11111010 # instruction | CLI | Keep hardware interrupts disabled during flag sampling.
11101010 00000110 01111100 00000000 00000000 # instruction | JMP 0000:7C06 | Normalize CS.
00110001 11000000 # instruction | XOR AX,AX | Prepare segment zero.
10001110 11010000 # instruction | MOV SS,AX | Initialize the native sampling stack.
10001110 11011000 # instruction | MOV DS,AX | Set DS to zero.
10001110 11000000 # instruction | MOV ES,AX | STOSW samples use ES zero.
10111100 00000000 01111100 # instruction | MOV SP,7C00 | Initialize SP.
11111100 # instruction | CLD | Advance DI after each sample word.
10111111 00000000 00100000 # instruction | MOV DI,2000 | Output eight result/FLAGS pairs at physical 2000.
10111000 11111111 01111111 # instruction | MOV AX,7FFF | Word signed-positive boundary.
11111001 # instruction | STC | Incoming carry one.
00010101 00000000 00000000 # instruction | ADC AX,0000 | Produce 8000 with signed overflow and half carry.
10101011 # instruction | STOSW | Record the result while preserving flags.
10011100 # instruction | PUSHF | Native-only flag sampling; the model does not execute PUSHF.
01011000 # instruction | POP AX | Fetch actual sampled native FLAGS.
10101011 # instruction | STOSW | Record FLAGS.
10111000 11111111 11111111 # instruction | MOV AX,FFFF | Word unsigned boundary.
11111000 # instruction | CLC | Incoming carry zero.
